					( N WHICH IS -1 IF THE WORD IS NON-)
					( IMMEDIATE AND 1 IF THE WORD IS   )
					( IMMEDIATE.			   )
 DUP CFIELD -1 ROT C@ 80 AND IF NEGATE THEN ;

: FIND					( ADDR[NAME] --- ADDR2 N )   ( TRIES )
					( TO FIND NAME IN THE DICTIONARY.    )
